{
  "_comment": "The D-M drills' plan (RFC-0004 A13). Read by dmdrive.py and printed by `dm.sh plan`. Heights are DAA of the drill chain; at the observed ~133 s per DAA (27.7 DAA/h) 300 DAA is ~10.8 h. Every line runs the SAME windows: the grid, L_e = 315, so they open together. A setter set holds at most n items (spec 17 \u00a717.6.2), so every pool is cut into sets of eight.",
