    "T": {
      "_for": "D-M3, the court battery on evaluation claims: two executors (new5, new6) each commit ONE self-consistent lie on this line (new5 a moved step leaf, new6 a moved first id: --palw-drill-tamper-eval=<fault>@<T's id prefix>, the id is derived before the chain exists) and a challenger (new1, --palw-challenge) replays every claim it can, finds where each lie is from the accused's capture (the shared --palw-improve-capture-dir) and files the court proof. The lies are convicted; the honest claims, on this line and on every other, stay unvoided.",
